#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.desktop.in.in:2
msgid "Deskence"
msgstr "Deskence"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.desktop.in.in:3
msgid "Desktop Settings"
msgstr "Darbvirsmas iestatījumi"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.desktop.in.in:4
msgid ""
"Dock, desktop icons, application icons in the top bar and window buttons"
msgstr "Doks, darbvirsmas ikonas, lietotņu ikonas augšējā joslā un logu pogas"

#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons. The list MUST also end with a semicolon.
#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.desktop.in.in:6
msgid "dock;desktop;icons;tray;indicator;taskbar;minimize;maximize;"
msgstr ""
"doks;darbvirsma;ikonas;paziņojumu "
"apgabals;indikators;uzdevumjosla;minimizēt;maksimizēt;dock;desktop;icons;tray;indicator;taskbar;minimize;maximize;"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:7
msgid "Dock, desktop icons and tray for GNOME"
msgstr "Doks, darbvirsmas ikonas un paziņojumu apgabals GNOME vidē"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Deskence adds a few conveniences to the standard GNOME desktop and lets you "
"configure them in one place."
msgstr ""
"Deskence papildina standarta GNOME darbvirsmu ar dažām ērtībām un ļauj tās "
"iestatīt vienuviet."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"A dock with pinned and running applications, folders, drives and the trash, "
"and previews of windows"
msgstr ""
"Doks ar piespraustām un palaistām lietotnēm, mapēm, diskiem un miskasti, kā "
"arī logu priekšskatījumiem"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid "Files and folders on the desktop"
msgstr "Datnes un mapes uz darbvirsmas"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Application icons in the top bar, for example from messengers and file "
"synchronization"
msgstr ""
"Lietotņu ikonas augšējā joslā, piemēram, no tērzēšanas un datņu "
"sinhronizēšanas lietotnēm"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid "A clipboard history and Keep Awake in the quick settings"
msgstr "Starpliktuves vēsture un „Neļaut iemigt” ātrajos iestatījumos"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:15
msgid "Alphabetical order of the applications view"
msgstr "Lietotņu skata alfabētiskā secība"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid "Minimize and maximize buttons in window title bars"
msgstr "Minimizēšanas un maksimizēšanas pogas logu virsraksta joslās"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Presets to save settings and move them to another computer"
msgstr ""
"Priekšiestatījumi iestatījumu saglabāšanai un pārnešanai uz citu datoru"

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"It works in your existing GNOME session and keeps the standard GNOME look."
msgstr ""
"Tas darbojas jūsu esošajā GNOME sesijā un saglabā ierasto GNOME izskatu."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:43
msgid ""
"Deskence is now available in 29 languages: all official languages of the "
"European Union, Korean, Simplified and Traditional Chinese, Serbian and "
"Filipino. The language list in the settings names the language the system "
"uses."
msgstr ""
"Deskence tagad ir pieejams 29 valodās: visās Eiropas Savienības oficiālajās "
"valodās, korejiešu, vienkāršotajā un tradicionālajā ķīniešu, serbu un "
"filipīniešu valodā. Iestatījumu valodu sarakstā norādīta valoda, ko izmanto "
"sistēma."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:48
msgid ""
"Settings: choose the language of the settings window and the deskence "
"command on the General page, independently of the system."
msgstr ""
"Iestatījumi: iestatījumu loga un komandas deskence valodu var izvēlēties "
"lapā „Vispārīgi”, neatkarīgi no sistēmas."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:53
msgid ""
"Dock: copy or cut files and folders in a folder panel (right click, Ctrl+C, "
"Ctrl+X) and paste them in Files or on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Doks: kopējiet vai izgrieziet datnes un mapes mapes panelī (labais klikšķis, "
"Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X) un ielīmējiet tās lietotnē „Datnes” vai uz darbvirsmas."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:58
msgid ""
"Dock: drag files and folders from a folder panel onto another folder in the "
"dock or onto the desktop to move or copy them."
msgstr ""
"Doks: velciet datnes un mapes no mapes paneļa uz citu doka mapi vai uz "
"darbvirsmu, lai tās pārvietotu vai kopētu."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:59
msgid ""
"Dock: applications only open dropped files of types they declare; otherwise "
"the dock says why."
msgstr ""
"Doks: lietotnes atver nomestās datnes tikai to tipu, kurus tās norāda; "
"citādi doks paskaidro, kāpēc."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:60
msgid "Dock: the marker under folders matches the dots of applications."
msgstr "Doks: atzīme zem mapēm atbilst lietotņu punktiem."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:65
msgid ""
"Start on the desktop: after logging in, the desktop, the top bar and windows "
"take clicks again when animations are off, for example in virtual machines "
"without 3D acceleration; before, only the dock did until the overview was "
"opened once."
msgstr ""
"Sākt uz darbvirsmas: pēc ierakstīšanās darbvirsma, augšējā josla un logi "
"atkal reaģē uz klikšķiem, kad animācijas ir izslēgtas, piemēram, virtuālajās "
"mašīnās bez 3D paātrinājuma; agrāk reaģēja tikai doks, līdz pārskats tika "
"atvērts vienreiz."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:70
msgid ""
"Optional diagnostics for reports of a desktop and windows that stop taking "
"clicks."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāta diagnostika ziņojumiem par darbvirsmu un logiem, kas pārstāj "
"reaģēt uz klikšķiem."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:75
msgid ""
"Dock: dragging files onto the dock always ends cleanly, also when something "
"fails during the drop."
msgstr ""
"Doks: datņu vilkšana uz doku vienmēr beidzas kārtīgi, arī tad, ja nometot "
"kaut kas neizdodas."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:80
msgid ""
"Dock: drop files on an application to open them in it, or on a folder to "
"copy or move them there; hold a file over a folder to open it and drop into "
"one of its subfolders."
msgstr ""
"Doks: nometiet datnes uz lietotnes, lai tās atvērtu tajā, vai uz mapes, lai "
"tās tur kopētu vai pārvietotu; turiet datni virs mapes, lai to atvērtu un "
"nomestu kādā no tās apakšmapēm."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:85
msgid ""
"Settings: search every setting with Ctrl+F, manage all keyboard shortcuts in "
"one place with checks for clashes, and copy or save a report for bug reports."
msgstr ""
"Iestatījumi: jebkura iestatījuma meklēšana ar Ctrl+F, visu tastatūras saīsņu "
"pārvaldība vienuviet ar konfliktu pārbaudi un atskaites kopēšana vai "
"saglabāšana kļūdu ziņojumiem."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:86
msgid ""
"Presets: undoing an applied preset restores only what it changed and keeps "
"settings you changed afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Priekšiestatījumi: pielietota priekšiestatījuma atsaukšana atjauno tikai to, "
"ko tas mainīja, un saglabā vēlāk mainītos iestatījumus."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:87
msgid ""
"Dock: unread counters and the progress of operations on application icons, "
"for applications that report them."
msgstr ""
"Doks: nelasīto skaitītāji un darbību progress lietotņu ikonās, ja lietotnes "
"tos paziņo."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:92
msgid ""
"Command line: check the state of each feature, turn features off and on, "
"apply, import and export presets, restore defaults and collect diagnostics "
"with the deskence command, also from a text console when the desktop does "
"not work. See man deskence."
msgstr ""
"Komandrinda: pārbaudiet katras funkcijas stāvokli, izslēdziet un ieslēdziet "
"funkcijas, pielietojiet, importējiet un eksportējiet priekšiestatījumus, "
"atjaunojiet noklusējuma iestatījumus un vāciet diagnostiku ar komandu "
"deskence, arī no teksta konsoles, kad darbvirsma nedarbojas. Skatiet man "
"deskence."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:93
msgid ""
"Restoring default settings no longer deletes a clipboard history that is "
"kept after logging out."
msgstr ""
"Noklusējuma iestatījumu atjaunošana vairs nedzēš starpliktuves vēsturi, kas "
"tiek saglabāta pēc izrakstīšanās."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:98
msgid ""
"Applications view: your own color and transparency for the highlight under "
"the pointer on applications and application folders; hovering a folder no "
"longer draws an outline."
msgstr ""
"Lietotņu skats: sava krāsa un caurspīdīgums izcēlumam zem rādītāja uz "
"lietotnēm un lietotņu mapēm; virzot pāri mapei, kontūra vairs netiek zīmēta."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:99
msgid ""
"Folders in the dock: the panel takes at most half of the screen height and "
"scrolls through the whole folder, also with the keyboard, and returns to the "
"earlier position after a subfolder."
msgstr ""
"Mapes dokā: panelis aizņem ne vairāk kā pusi ekrāna augstuma, ritina visu "
"mapi, arī ar tastatūru, un pēc apakšmapes atgriežas iepriekšējā vietā."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:100
msgid ""
"Settings: clearer descriptions, better Polish wording and fewer clashing "
"keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"Iestatījumi: skaidrāki apraksti, labāki poļu formulējumi un mazāk "
"konfliktējošu tastatūras saīsņu."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:105
msgid ""
"Dock: a dock along the whole edge matches the top bar in the activities "
"overview and the applications view; a short dock keeps its own look."
msgstr ""
"Doks: doks visas malas garumā aktivitāšu pārskatā un lietotņu skatā saskan "
"ar augšējo joslu; īss doks saglabā savu izskatu."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:106
msgid ""
"Applications view: folder tiles with your own color or transparency now "
"clearly show hover, press, focus and selection."
msgstr ""
"Lietotņu skats: mapju flīzes ar savu krāsu vai caurspīdīgumu tagad skaidri "
"parāda virzīšanu, nospiešanu, fokusu un atlasi."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:111
msgid ""
"Applications view: your own color and transparency for folder tiles such as "
"“Utilities”."
msgstr ""
"Lietotņu skats: sava krāsa un caurspīdīgums mapju flīzēm, piemēram, "
"„Utilītas”."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:112
msgid ""
"General: optionally start on the desktop instead of the activities overview "
"after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Vispārīgi: pēc izvēles pēc ierakstīšanās sākt uz darbvirsmas, nevis "
"aktivitāšu pārskatā."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:113
msgid ""
"Dock: it now blends into the activities overview instead of forming a "
"separate band."
msgstr ""
"Doks: tagad tas saplūst ar aktivitāšu pārskatu, nevis veido atsevišķu joslu."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:118
msgid ""
"Project homepage and bug tracker links, English documentation. No changes to "
"the application."
msgstr ""
"Saites uz projekta lapu un kļūdu izsekotāju, dokumentācija angļu valodā. "
"Lietotnē izmaiņu nav."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:123
msgid ""
"Settings: a General page with presets, exporting and importing settings and "
"restoring defaults; an Applications View page with alphabetical sorting; "
"calmer previews."
msgstr ""
"Iestatījumi: lapa „Vispārīgi” ar priekšiestatījumiem, iestatījumu eksportu "
"un importu un noklusējuma vērtību atjaunošanu; lapa „Lietotņu skats” ar "
"alfabētisko kārtošanu; mierīgāki priekšskatījumi."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:124
msgid ""
"Dock: folders that show their contents, closing and peeking at windows from "
"their previews, Always on Top in the preview menu."
msgstr ""
"Doks: mapes, kas rāda savu saturu, logu aizvēršana un ieskatīšanās tajos no "
"to priekšskatījumiem, „Vienmēr virspusē” priekšskatījuma izvēlnē."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:125
msgid ""
"New: clipboard history, Keep Awake in the quick settings, an Always on Top "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Jaunums: starpliktuves vēsture, „Neļaut iemigt” ātrajos iestatījumos, saīsne "
"funkcijai „Vienmēr virspusē”."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:130
msgid ""
"Better GNOME Desktop is now called Deskence. Settings, enabled features, "
"pinned applications and desktop icon positions are taken over."
msgstr ""
"Better GNOME Desktop tagad saucas Deskence. Iestatījumi, ieslēgtās "
"funkcijas, piespraustās lietotnes un darbvirsmas ikonu novietojumi tiek "
"pārņemti."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:131
msgid ""
"Dock: previews of the windows of an application when the pointer rests on "
"it, no extra space next to the applications button when icons are magnified, "
"running indicators under the icons of a bottom dock."
msgstr ""
"Doks: lietotnes logu priekšskatījumi, kad rādītājs uz tās apstājas, nav "
"papildu vietas blakus lietotņu pogai, palielinot ikonas, darbības indikatori "
"zem apakšējā doka ikonām."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:132
msgid ""
"Settings: larger, clearer previews of the dock and the desktop icons, page "
"icons, an “About” menu item."
msgstr ""
"Iestatījumi: lielāki un skaidrāki doka un darbvirsmas ikonu priekšskatījumi, "
"lapu ikonas, izvēlnes vienums „Par”."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:137
msgid "Better GNOME Desktop is now called Deskence."
msgstr "Better GNOME Desktop tagad saucas Deskence."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:142
msgid ""
"Dock: sharp magnified icons, no tiles under icons with a custom background, "
"monochrome distribution logo, the application list kept at the start of a "
"dock along the whole edge, running indicators on the inner side."
msgstr ""
"Doks: asas palielinātas ikonas, nav flīžu zem ikonām ar savu fonu, "
"vienkrāsains distributīva logotips, lietotņu saraksts visas malas garuma "
"doka sākumā, darbības indikatori iekšpusē."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:143
msgid ""
"Applications view: one continuous closing transition, optional custom "
"background color."
msgstr ""
"Lietotņu skats: viena nepārtraukta pāreja aizverot, neobligāta sava fona "
"krāsa."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:144
msgid ""
"Desktop: menus open at the clicked point, also beside the dock; the icon "
"grid starts at the chosen corner with small margins."
msgstr ""
"Darbvirsma: izvēlnes atveras klikšķa vietā, arī blakus dokam; ikonu režģis "
"sākas izvēlētajā stūrī ar nelielām malām."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:149
msgid ""
"Dock: applications button at either end with a choice of icon, magnified "
"icons, scrolling when the applications do not fit, custom background color "
"and transparency, settings in the applications button menu, transparent "
"background for the applications view."
msgstr ""
"Doks: lietotņu poga jebkurā galā ar ikonas izvēli, palielinātas ikonas, "
"ritināšana, kad lietotnes neietilpst, sava fona krāsa un caurspīdīgums, "
"iestatījumi lietotņu pogas izvēlnē, caurspīdīgs fons lietotņu skatam."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:150
msgid ""
"Desktop icons: free placement or snapping to the grid, \"Align to Grid\", "
"the whole desktop beside the dock usable, icon positions that do not move "
"with the dock."
msgstr ""
"Darbvirsmas ikonas: brīvs izvietojums vai piesaiste režģim, „Līdzināt "
"režģim”, visa darbvirsma blakus dokam izmantojama, ikonu novietojumi, kas "
"nepārvietojas kopā ar doku."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:151
msgid ""
"Fixes: smooth closing of the applications view, immediate reordering of dock "
"icons, no frame while dragging desktop icons, one desktop menu everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Labojumi: vienmērīga lietotņu skata aizvēršana, tūlītēja doka ikonu "
"pārkārtošana, nav rāmja, velkot darbvirsmas ikonas, visur viena un tā pati "
"darbvirsmas izvēlne."

#: data/io.github.deskence.Deskence.metainfo.xml.in:156
msgid "First release."
msgstr "Pirmais laidiens."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:116
msgid "Settings layout version"
msgstr "Iestatījumu struktūras versija"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:117
msgid ""
"Used by the settings application to migrate stored values between releases. "
"0 means the settings were never migrated."
msgstr ""
"To izmanto iestatījumu lietotne, lai migrētu saglabātās vērtības starp "
"laidieniem. 0 nozīmē, ka iestatījumi nekad nav migrēti."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:121
msgid "Settings of Better GNOME Desktop were taken over"
msgstr "Better GNOME Desktop iestatījumi ir pārņemti"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:122
msgid ""
"Set once the settings stored by Better GNOME Desktop (0.3.0 and older) were "
"copied here. Values already set here are never overwritten; the former "
"settings are kept."
msgstr ""
"Tiek iestatīts, kad Better GNOME Desktop (0.3.0 un vecākas versijas) "
"saglabātie iestatījumi ir nokopēti šeit. Šeit jau iestatītās vērtības nekad "
"netiek pārrakstītas; iepriekšējie iestatījumi tiek saglabāti."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:126
msgid "Show the desktop after logging in"
msgstr "Rādīt darbvirsmu pēc ierakstīšanās"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:127
msgid ""
"When true, a new session starts on the desktop instead of the activities "
"overview. Only the start of the session is affected: opening the overview "
"later, unlocking the screen or turning features on and off never closes it. "
"Applied by the dock extension."
msgstr ""
"Ja patiess, jauna sesija sākas uz darbvirsmas, nevis aktivitāšu pārskatā. "
"Tiek ietekmēts tikai sesijas sākums: vēlāka pārskata atvēršana, ekrāna "
"atslēgšana vai funkciju ieslēgšana un izslēgšana to nekad neaizver. To "
"pielieto doka paplašinājums."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:131
msgid "Language of the Deskence application"
msgstr "Lietotnes Deskence valoda"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:132
msgid ""
"The language of the settings window and of the deskence command: the code of "
"a translation installed with Deskence (for example \"pl\"), \"en\" for "
"English, or empty to follow the system. A code without an installed "
"translation means English. The GNOME Shell extensions and the desktop icons "
"always follow the language of GNOME Shell. Applied when the application "
"starts."
msgstr ""
"Iestatījumu loga un komandas deskence valoda: ar Deskence instalēta "
"tulkojuma kods (piemēram, \"pl\"), \"en\" angļu valodai vai tukšs, lai "
"sekotu sistēmai. Kods bez instalēta tulkojuma nozīmē angļu valodu. GNOME "
"Shell paplašinājumi un darbvirsmas ikonas vienmēr seko GNOME Shell valodai. "
"Tiek pielietots, palaižot lietotni."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:146
msgid "Screen edge of the dock"
msgstr "Ekrāna mala dokam"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:147
msgid "\"left\", \"bottom\" or \"right\"."
msgstr "\"left\" (pa kreisi), \"bottom\" (apakšā) vai \"right\" (pa labi)."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:151
msgid "Dock length"
msgstr "Doka garums"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:152
msgid ""
"\"fit\": only as long as the icons need. \"full\": the whole screen edge."
msgstr "\"fit\": tikai tik garš, cik vajag ikonām. \"full\": visa ekrāna mala."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:157
msgid "Icon size in logical pixels"
msgstr "Ikonu izmērs loģiskajos pikseļos"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:158
msgid ""
"Scaled by the monitor scale and the text scaling factor of the shell theme "
"like other GNOME Shell icons."
msgstr ""
"Mērogots atbilstoši monitora mērogam un čaulas motīva teksta mērogošanas "
"koeficientam, tāpat kā citas GNOME Shell ikonas."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:162
msgid "When the dock hides"
msgstr "Kad doks paslēpjas"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:163
msgid ""
"\"never\": always visible and windows are kept out of its area. "
"\"intellihide\": hidden while a window on the same monitor overlaps it. "
"\"autohide\": hidden until the pointer reaches the screen edge."
msgstr ""
"\"never\": vienmēr redzams, un logi tiek turēti ārpus tā apgabala. "
"\"intellihide\": paslēpts, kamēr to aizsedz logs tajā pašā monitorā. "
"\"autohide\": paslēpts, līdz rādītājs sasniedz ekrāna malu."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:167
msgid "On which monitors the dock is shown"
msgstr "Kuros monitoros rādīt doku"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:168
msgid "\"primary\", \"selected\" (see selected-monitor) or \"all\"."
msgstr ""
"\"primary\" (galvenais), \"selected\" (izvēlētais, skatiet selected-monitor) "
"vai \"all\" (visi)."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:172
msgid "Connector of the selected monitor"
msgstr "Izvēlētā monitora savienotājs"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:173
msgid ""
"Connector name such as \"DP-1\". Used when monitor-mode is \"selected\"; "
"falls back to the primary monitor while that monitor is not connected."
msgstr ""
"Savienotāja nosaukums, piemēram, \"DP-1\". Tiek izmantots, kad monitor-mode "
"ir \"selected\"; kamēr šis monitors nav pievienots, tiek izmantots galvenais "
"monitors."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:177
#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:369
msgid "Show the trash"
msgstr "Rādīt miskasti"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:181
msgid "Show removable drives"
msgstr "Rādīt izņemamos diskus"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:185
msgid "Show network locations"
msgstr "Rādīt tīkla vietas"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:189
msgid "Show the applications button"
msgstr "Rādīt lietotņu pogu"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:193
msgid "Where the applications button is"
msgstr "Kur atrodas lietotņu poga"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:194
msgid ""
"\"start\": first item of the dock (left in a horizontal dock, top in a "
"vertical one). \"end\": last item (right or bottom)."
msgstr ""
"\"start\": doka pirmais vienums (pa kreisi horizontālā dokā, augšā "
"vertikālā). \"end\": pēdējais vienums (pa labi vai apakšā)."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:198
msgid "Icon of the applications button"
msgstr "Lietotņu pogas ikona"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:199
msgid ""
"\"default\": the GNOME applications icon. \"distribution\": the logo of the "
"installed distribution, from the icons installed on the system; the default "
"icon when there is none. \"custom\": the image in apps-button-custom-icon."
msgstr ""
"\"default\": GNOME lietotņu ikona. \"distribution\": instalētā distributīva "
"logotips no sistēmā instalētajām ikonām; noklusējuma ikona, ja tāda nav. "
"\"custom\": attēls no apps-button-custom-icon."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:203
msgid "Custom icon of the applications button"
msgstr "Lietotņu pogas sava ikona"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:204
msgid ""
"Path of a copy of the chosen image, kept in the user data folder of Deskence "
"so it keeps working when the original file is moved or deleted. The default "
"icon is used when the file cannot be loaded."
msgstr ""
"Ceļš uz izvēlētā attēla kopiju, kas glabājas Deskence lietotāja datu mapē, "
"lai tā darbotos arī tad, ja sākotnējā datne tiek pārvietota vai dzēsta. Ja "
"datni nevar ielādēt, tiek izmantota noklusējuma ikona."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:208
msgid "Magnify icons under the pointer"
msgstr "Palielināt ikonas zem rādītāja"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:209
msgid ""
"Icons near the pointer grow smoothly while it moves over the dock. Not shown "
"while animations are turned off in GNOME."
msgstr ""
"Ikonas rādītāja tuvumā vienmērīgi palielinās, kamēr tas pārvietojas pār "
"doku. Netiek rādīts, kamēr GNOME animācijas ir izslēgtas."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:214
msgid "Magnification strength"
msgstr "Palielinājuma stiprums"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:215
msgid "Size of the icon under the pointer relative to its normal size."
msgstr "Ikonas zem rādītāja izmērs attiecībā pret tās parasto izmēru."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:219
msgid "Custom dock background color"
msgstr "Sava doka fona krāsa"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:220
msgid ""
"When false, the dock background has the color of the current GNOME style."
msgstr "Ja aplams, doka fonam ir pašreizējā GNOME stila krāsa."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:224
msgid "Dock background color"
msgstr "Doka fona krāsa"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:225
msgid ""
"Color as \"#rrggbb\", used when background-custom-color is true. It has no "
"transparency of its own: that is background-transparency."
msgstr ""
"Krāsa formā \"#rrggbb\", tiek izmantota, kad background-custom-color ir "
"patiess. Tai nav sava caurspīdīguma: tas ir background-transparency."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:229
msgid "Custom dock background transparency"
msgstr "Savs doka fona caurspīdīgums"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:230
msgid ""
"When false, the dock background is as transparent as the current GNOME style "
"makes it."
msgstr ""
"Ja aplams, doka fons ir tik caurspīdīgs, cik to padara pašreizējais GNOME "
"stils."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:235
msgid "Dock background transparency"
msgstr "Doka fona caurspīdīgums"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:236
msgid ""
"0: opaque. 100: fully transparent. Only the background; icons, indicators, "
"labels and menus keep their own visibility. Used when background-custom-"
"transparency is true."
msgstr ""
"0: necaurspīdīgs. 100: pilnīgi caurspīdīgs. Tikai fons; ikonas, indikatori, "
"uzraksti un izvēlnes saglabā savu redzamību. Tiek izmantots, kad background-"
"custom-transparency ir patiess."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:240
msgid "Custom background transparency of the applications view"
msgstr "Savs lietotņu skata fona caurspīdīgums"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:241
msgid ""
"When false, the full-screen applications view opened from the dock has the "
"standard GNOME background."
msgstr ""
"Ja aplams, no doka atvērtajam pilnekrāna lietotņu skatam ir standarta GNOME "
"fons."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:245
msgid "Custom background color of the applications view"
msgstr "Sava lietotņu skata fona krāsa"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:246
msgid ""
"When false, the full-screen applications view opened from the dock has the "
"color of the standard GNOME background. Independent of the dock background."
msgstr ""
"Ja aplams, no doka atvērtajam pilnekrāna lietotņu skatam ir standarta GNOME "
"fona krāsa. Neatkarīgi no doka fona."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:250
msgid "Background color of the applications view"
msgstr "Lietotņu skata fona krāsa"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:251
msgid ""
"Color as \"#rrggbb\", used when app-grid-custom-color is true. It has no "
"transparency of its own: that is app-grid-transparency (or opaque when app-"
"grid-custom-transparency is false)."
msgstr ""
"Krāsa formā \"#rrggbb\", tiek izmantota, kad app-grid-custom-color ir "
"patiess. Tai nav sava caurspīdīguma: tas ir app-grid-transparency (vai "
"necaurspīdīga, kad app-grid-custom-transparency ir aplams)."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:256
msgid "Background transparency of the applications view"
msgstr "Lietotņu skata fona caurspīdīgums"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:257
msgid ""
"0: opaque background (standard or custom color). 100: fully transparent, "
"only the wallpaper is visible behind the applications. Only the background "
"changes; icons, names and the search entry stay fully visible. Used when app-"
"grid-custom-transparency is true."
msgstr ""
"0: necaurspīdīgs fons (standarta vai sava krāsa). 100: pilnīgi caurspīdīgs, "
"aiz lietotnēm redzams tikai fona attēls. Mainās tikai fons; ikonas, "
"nosaukumi un meklēšanas lauks paliek pilnīgi redzami. Tiek izmantots, kad "
"app-grid-custom-transparency ir patiess."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:261
msgid "Custom background color of application folders"
msgstr "Sava lietotņu mapju fona krāsa"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:262
msgid ""
"When false, the folder tiles in the applications view (such as "
"\"Utilities\") have the color of the current GNOME style. Only the tile "
"background changes; the application thumbnails and the folder name stay as "
"they are, and the panel of an open folder is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Ja aplams, lietotņu skata mapju flīzēm (piemēram, \"Utilītas\") ir "
"pašreizējā GNOME stila krāsa. Mainās tikai flīzes fons; lietotņu sīktēli un "
"mapes nosaukums paliek nemainīgi, un atvērtas mapes panelis netiek ietekmēts."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:266
msgid "Background color of application folders"
msgstr "Lietotņu mapju fona krāsa"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:267
msgid ""
"Color as \"#rrggbb\", used when app-grid-folder-custom-color is true. It has "
"no transparency of its own: that is app-grid-folder-transparency (or the "
"alpha of the GNOME style when app-grid-folder-custom-transparency is false)."
msgstr ""
"Krāsa formā \"#rrggbb\", tiek izmantota, kad app-grid-folder-custom-color ir "
"patiess. Tai nav sava caurspīdīguma: tas ir app-grid-folder-transparency "
"(vai GNOME stila alfa, kad app-grid-folder-custom-transparency ir aplams)."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:271
msgid "Custom background transparency of application folders"
msgstr "Savs lietotņu mapju fona caurspīdīgums"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:272
msgid ""
"When false, the folder tiles in the applications view are as opaque as the "
"current GNOME style makes them."
msgstr ""
"Ja aplams, lietotņu skata mapju flīzes ir tik necaurspīdīgas, cik tās padara "
"pašreizējais GNOME stils."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:277
msgid "Background transparency of application folders"
msgstr "Lietotņu mapju fona caurspīdīgums"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:278
msgid ""
"0: opaque tile background. 100: fully transparent; the folder is recognized "
"by its application thumbnails and name. Hover, selection and keyboard focus "
"stay visible. Used when app-grid-folder-custom-transparency is true."
msgstr ""
"0: necaurspīdīgs flīzes fons. 100: pilnīgi caurspīdīgs; mapi var atpazīt pēc "
"lietotņu sīktēliem un nosaukuma. Virzīšana, atlase un tastatūras fokuss "
"paliek redzami. Tiek izmantots, kad app-grid-folder-custom-transparency ir "
"patiess."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:282
msgid "Custom hover highlight color in the applications view"
msgstr "Sava virzīšanas izcēluma krāsa lietotņu skatā"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:283
msgid ""
"When false, the highlight shown under the pointer on applications, "
"application folders and applications inside an open folder has the color of "
"the current GNOME style. The dock, the desktop and folder stacks are not "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"Ja aplams, izcēlumam zem rādītāja uz lietotnēm, lietotņu mapēm un lietotnēm "
"atvērtā mapē ir pašreizējā GNOME stila krāsa. Doks, darbvirsma un mapju "
"kaudzes netiek ietekmētas."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:287
msgid "Hover highlight color in the applications view"
msgstr "Virzīšanas izcēluma krāsa lietotņu skatā"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:288
msgid ""
"Color as \"#rrggbb\", used when app-grid-hover-custom-color is true. It has "
"no transparency of its own: that is app-grid-hover-transparency (or the "
"alpha of the GNOME style when app-grid-hover-custom-transparency is false)."
msgstr ""
"Krāsa formā \"#rrggbb\", tiek izmantota, kad app-grid-hover-custom-color ir "
"patiess. Tai nav sava caurspīdīguma: tas ir app-grid-hover-transparency (vai "
"GNOME stila alfa, kad app-grid-hover-custom-transparency ir aplams)."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:292
msgid "Custom hover highlight transparency in the applications view"
msgstr "Savs virzīšanas izcēluma caurspīdīgums lietotņu skatā"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:293
msgid ""
"When false, the hover highlight is as opaque as the current GNOME style "
"makes it."
msgstr ""
"Ja aplams, virzīšanas izcēlums ir tik necaurspīdīgs, cik to padara "
"pašreizējais GNOME stils."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:298
msgid "Hover highlight transparency in the applications view"
msgstr "Virzīšanas izcēluma caurspīdīgums lietotņu skatā"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:299
msgid ""
"0: opaque highlight. 100: fully transparent; a folder then looks the same "
"under the pointer as at rest. Only the highlight changes; icons and names "
"stay fully visible, and keyboard focus stays marked. Used when app-grid-"
"hover-custom-transparency is true."
msgstr ""
"0: necaurspīdīgs izcēlums. 100: pilnīgi caurspīdīgs; mape tad zem rādītāja "
"izskatās tāpat kā miera stāvoklī. Mainās tikai izcēlums; ikonas un nosaukumi "
"paliek pilnīgi redzami, un tastatūras fokuss paliek atzīmēts. Tiek "
"izmantots, kad app-grid-hover-custom-transparency ir patiess."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:303
msgid "Clicking a running application"
msgstr "Klikšķis uz palaistas lietotnes"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:304
msgid ""
"\"focus-or-cycle\": focus the most recently used window; when the "
"application is already focused, switch to its next window. \"minimize-or-"
"cycle\": like focus-or-cycle, but an application with a single focused "
"window is minimized."
msgstr ""
"\"focus-or-cycle\": fokusē pēdējo izmantoto logu; ja lietotne jau ir fokusā, "
"pārslēdzas uz tās nākamo logu. \"minimize-or-cycle\": kā focus-or-cycle, bet "
"lietotne ar vienu fokusētu logu tiek minimizēta."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:308
msgid "Only show applications of the current workspace"
msgstr "Rādīt tikai pašreizējās darbvietas lietotnes"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:309
msgid ""
"When true, running (non-pinned) applications are listed only when they have "
"a window on the active workspace, and clicking cycles only through those "
"windows."
msgstr ""
"Ja patiess, palaistās (nepiespraustās) lietotnes tiek rādītas tikai tad, kad "
"tām ir logs aktīvajā darbvietā, un klikšķis pārslēdz tikai starp šiem logiem."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:313
msgid "Show counters of applications"
msgstr "Rādīt lietotņu skaitītājus"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:314
msgid ""
"When true, an application that reports a counter (for example unread "
"messages, through the LauncherEntry D-Bus API) shows it on its dock icon. "
"Applications that report nothing show nothing."
msgstr ""
"Ja patiess, lietotne, kas paziņo skaitītāju (piemēram, nelasītos ziņojumus, "
"izmantojot D-Bus API LauncherEntry), rāda to savā doka ikonā. Lietotnes, kas "
"neko nepaziņo, neko nerāda."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:318
msgid "Show progress of applications"
msgstr "Rādīt lietotņu progresu"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:319
msgid ""
"When true, an application that reports the progress of an operation (for "
"example a download, through the LauncherEntry D-Bus API) shows it as a bar "
"on its dock icon."
msgstr ""
"Ja patiess, lietotne, kas paziņo darbības progresu (piemēram, lejupielādes, "
"izmantojot D-Bus API LauncherEntry), rāda to kā joslu savā doka ikonā."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:323
msgid "Show window previews on hover"
msgstr "Rādīt logu priekšskatījumus, virzot rādītāju"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:324
msgid ""
"When the pointer rests on a running application, show its windows (the ones "
"the dock counts, see isolate-workspaces) with their titles; clicking one "
"activates that window."
msgstr ""
"Kad rādītājs apstājas uz palaistas lietotnes, tiek parādīti tās logi (tie, "
"kurus skaita doks, skatiet isolate-workspaces) ar virsrakstiem; klikšķis uz "
"viena aktivizē šo logu."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:328
msgid "Peek at a window from its preview"
msgstr "Ieskatīties logā no tā priekšskatījuma"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:329
msgid ""
"While the pointer rests on a window preview, that window is shown over the "
"dimmed others for a moment. Nothing is focused, raised, restored or moved; "
"leaving the preview or pressing Escape ends it."
msgstr ""
"Kamēr rādītājs atrodas uz loga priekšskatījuma, šis logs uz brīdi tiek "
"parādīts virs pārējiem, aptumšotajiem. Nekas netiek fokusēts, pacelts, "
"atjaunots vai pārvietots; priekšskatījuma pamešana vai Escape nospiešana to "
"beidz."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:333
msgid "Folders in the dock"
msgstr "Mapes dokā"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:334
msgid ""
"Folders shown in the dock, in order. Each entry is \"xdg:NAME\" for a "
"standard folder (NAME as in GLib.UserDirectory without the DIRECTORY_ "
"prefix, for example \"xdg:DOWNLOAD\"), \"home:RELATIVE/PATH\" for a folder "
"in the home folder, or a \"file://\" URI for any other folder. Removing an "
"entry never touches the folder."
msgstr ""
"Dokā rādītās mapes secībā. Katrs ieraksts ir \"xdg:NOSAUKUMS\" standarta "
"mapei (NOSAUKUMS kā GLib.UserDirectory bez prefiksa DIRECTORY_, piemēram, "
"\"xdg:DOWNLOAD\"), \"home:RELATĪVAIS/CEĻŠ\" mapei mājas mapē vai \"file://\" "
"URI jebkurai citai mapei. Ieraksta izņemšana nekad neietekmē pašu mapi."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:338
msgid "Show folders in the dock"
msgstr "Rādīt mapes dokā"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:339
msgid "When false, the folders in folder-stacks are kept but not shown."
msgstr "Ja aplams, folder-stacks mapes tiek saglabātas, bet netiek rādītas."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:343
msgid "How folder contents are shown"
msgstr "Kā tiek rādīts mapju saturs"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:344
msgid ""
"\"grid\": large icons. \"list\": smaller icons with size and date. Changed "
"from the folder panel."
msgstr ""
"\"grid\": lielas ikonas. \"list\": mazākas ikonas ar izmēru un datumu. "
"Mainās mapes panelī."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:348
msgid "Sort order of each folder"
msgstr "Katras mapes kārtošanas secība"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:349
msgid ""
"Maps an entry of folder-stacks to \"name\", \"modified\" (newest first) or "
"\"type\". A folder without an entry is sorted by name, except Downloads "
"(xdg:DOWNLOAD), which shows the newest files first. Changed from the folder "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"Piesaista folder-stacks ierakstam \"name\", \"modified\" (jaunākās vispirms) "
"vai \"type\". Mape bez ieraksta tiek kārtota pēc nosaukuma, izņemot "
"„Lejupielādes” (xdg:DOWNLOAD), kas vispirms rāda jaunākās datnes. Mainās "
"mapes panelī."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:356
msgid "Desktop icon size"
msgstr "Darbvirsmas ikonu izmērs"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:357
msgid ""
"\"small\" (48 px), \"medium\" (64 px), \"large\" (96 px) or \"huge\" (128 "
"px)."
msgstr ""
"\"small\" (48 px), \"medium\" (64 px), \"large\" (96 px) vai \"huge\" (128 "
"px)."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:361
msgid "Corner where new icons are placed"
msgstr "Stūris, kurā novieto jaunās ikonas"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:365
msgid "Show the home folder"
msgstr "Rādīt mājas mapi"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:373
msgid "Show drives and USB sticks"
msgstr "Rādīt diskus un USB zibatmiņas"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:377
msgid "How moved icons are placed"
msgstr "Kā novieto pārvietotās ikonas"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:378
msgid ""
"\"free\": icons stay exactly where they are dropped. \"grid\": dropped icons "
"snap to the grid. Changing this does not move existing icons; \"Align to "
"Grid\" in the desktop menu does."
msgstr ""
"\"free\": ikonas paliek tieši tur, kur tās nomestas. \"grid\": nomestās "
"ikonas piesaistās režģim. Izmaiņa nepārvieto esošās ikonas; to dara "
"darbvirsmas izvēlnes vienums „Līdzināt režģim”."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:382
msgid "Open items with a single or double click"
msgstr "Atvērt vienumus ar vienu vai dubultklikšķi"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:386
msgid "Order used by \"Arrange Icons\""
msgstr "Secība, ko izmanto „Kārtot ikonas”"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:387
msgid "Changed from the desktop menu \"Sort By\"."
msgstr "Mainās darbvirsmas izvēlnē „Kārtot pēc”."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:394
msgid "Show passive application icons"
msgstr "Rādīt pasīvās lietotņu ikonas"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:395
msgid ""
"StatusNotifierItem defines a \"Passive\" status for icons an application "
"considers unimportant. They are hidden unless this is true."
msgstr ""
"StatusNotifierItem definē statusu \"Passive\" ikonām, kuras lietotne uzskata "
"par nesvarīgām. Tās ir paslēptas, ja vien šis nav patiess."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:402
msgid "Button layout before the first change"
msgstr "Pogu izkārtojums pirms pirmās izmaiņas"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:403
msgid ""
"Value of org.gnome.desktop.wm.preferences button-layout saved before "
"Deskence changed it for the first time. Empty when nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"org.gnome.desktop.wm.preferences button-layout vērtība, saglabāta pirms "
"Deskence to pirmo reizi mainīja. Tukšs, ja nekas nav mainīts."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:407
msgid "Button layout last written by Deskence"
msgstr "Pogu izkārtojums, ko Deskence ierakstīja pēdējo"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:408
msgid ""
"Used to tell whether the user changed the layout elsewhere afterwards; the "
"original value is only offered for restoring while the current value still "
"equals this one."
msgstr ""
"Tiek izmantots, lai noteiktu, vai lietotājs vēlāk izkārtojumu mainīja citur; "
"sākotnējā vērtība tiek piedāvāta atjaunošanai tikai tik ilgi, kamēr "
"pašreizējā vērtība joprojām ir vienāda ar šo."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:415
msgid "Order of the applications view"
msgstr "Lietotņu skata secība"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:416
msgid ""
"\"custom\": the arrangement made by the user (GNOME's own app-picker-layout "
"and folder lists). \"alphabetical\": applications and folders by display "
"name in the user's language, and the applications inside each folder too; "
"rearranging by dragging is turned off. Kept up to date by the app-grid "
"extension."
msgstr ""
"\"custom\": lietotāja veidotais izkārtojums (paša GNOME app-picker-layout un "
"mapju saraksti). \"alphabetical\": lietotnes un mapes pēc attēlojamā "
"nosaukuma lietotāja valodā, arī lietotnes katrā mapē; pārkārtošana velkot ir "
"izslēgta. To uztur aktuālu paplašinājums app-grid."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:420
msgid "Arrangement saved before sorting alphabetically"
msgstr "Izkārtojums, saglabāts pirms alfabētiskās kārtošanas"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:421
msgid ""
"JSON written when sort-mode changes to \"alphabetical\": the previous "
"org.gnome.shell app-picker-layout (GVariant text) and the application list "
"of each folder. It is restored when sort-mode goes back to \"custom\". "
"Internal; not part of presets."
msgstr ""
"JSON, ko ieraksta, kad sort-mode mainās uz \"alphabetical\": iepriekšējais "
"org.gnome.shell app-picker-layout (GVariant teksts) un katras mapes lietotņu "
"saraksts. Tas tiek atjaunots, kad sort-mode atgriežas uz \"custom\". "
"Iekšējs; nav priekšiestatījumu daļa."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:428
msgid "Shortcut that opens the clipboard history"
msgstr "Saīsne, kas atver starpliktuves vēsturi"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:433
msgid "Largest number of remembered items"
msgstr "Lielākais atcerēto vienumu skaits"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:434
msgid "Pinned items do not count. The oldest items are forgotten first."
msgstr ""
"Piespraustie vienumi netiek skaitīti. Vecākie vienumi tiek aizmirsti "
"vispirms."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:438
msgid "What is kept after logging out"
msgstr "Kas tiek saglabāts pēc izrakstīšanās"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:439
msgid ""
"\"nothing\": the history is only kept in memory and is gone after logging "
"out. \"pinned\": pinned items are saved in the user data folder. \"all\": "
"the whole history is saved there."
msgstr ""
"\"nothing\": vēsture tiek glabāta tikai atmiņā un pēc izrakstīšanās pazūd. "
"\"pinned\": piespraustie vienumi tiek saglabāti lietotāja datu mapē. "
"\"all\": tur tiek saglabāta visa vēsture."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:443
msgid "Do not remember new items"
msgstr "Neatcerēties jaunus vienumus"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:444
msgid "Temporary state changed from the history panel; not part of presets."
msgstr ""
"Pagaidu stāvoklis, ko maina vēstures panelī; nav priekšiestatījumu daļa."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:448
msgid "Also remember selected text"
msgstr "Atcerēties arī atlasīto tekstu"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:449
msgid ""
"Text selected with the mouse (the primary selection, pasted with the middle "
"button) is added to the history too."
msgstr ""
"Ar peli atlasītais teksts (primārā atlase, ko ielīmē ar vidējo pogu) arī "
"tiek pievienots vēsturei."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:453
msgid "Always paste text without formatting"
msgstr "Vienmēr ielīmēt tekstu bez formatējuma"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:454
msgid ""
"The history keeps text without formatting; only the newest item, while the "
"application it was copied from still provides it, can be pasted with its "
"formatting. When true, that item is pasted as plain text too. Shift+Enter in "
"the history pastes plain text either way."
msgstr ""
"Vēsture glabā tekstu bez formatējuma; tikai jaunāko vienumu var ielīmēt ar "
"formatējumu, kamēr lietotne, no kuras tas nokopēts, to joprojām piedāvā. Ja "
"patiess, arī šis vienums tiek ielīmēts kā vienkāršs teksts. Shift+Enter "
"vēsturē jebkurā gadījumā ielīmē vienkāršu tekstu."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:458
msgid "Paste the chosen item at once"
msgstr "Uzreiz ielīmēt izvēlēto vienumu"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:459
msgid ""
"When true, choosing an item closes the panel and pastes it into the window "
"that was focused, with Ctrl+V. When false, the item is only put on the "
"clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Ja patiess, vienuma izvēle aizver paneli un ielīmē to logā, kas bija fokusā, "
"ar Ctrl+V. Ja aplams, vienums tiek tikai ievietots starpliktuvē."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:466
msgid "Also keep the screen on"
msgstr "Turēt ieslēgtu arī ekrānu"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:467
msgid ""
"When false, keeping the computer awake only prevents automatic suspend: the "
"screen still turns off and locks as usual. When true, the screen also stays "
"on and does not lock automatically."
msgstr ""
"Ja aplams, datora turēšana nomodā novērš tikai automātisku iesnaušanos: "
"ekrāns joprojām izslēdzas un bloķējas kā parasti. Ja patiess, arī ekrāns "
"paliek ieslēgts un automātiski nebloķējas."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:471
msgid "Duration used by the quick settings button"
msgstr "Ilgums, ko izmanto ātro iestatījumu poga"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:472
msgid "The duration chosen last; clicking the button uses it again."
msgstr "Pēdējais izvēlētais ilgums; klikšķis uz pogas to izmanto atkal."

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:477
msgid "Custom duration in minutes"
msgstr "Savs ilgums minūtēs"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:482
msgid "End time in minutes after midnight"
msgstr "Beigu laiks minūtēs pēc pusnakts"

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:483
msgid "Used by \"until a time\": the next occurrence of this local time."
msgstr ""
"To izmanto „līdz noteiktam laikam”: šī vietējā laika nākamā iestāšanās."

#: src/deskence/application.py:95
msgid ""
"Open a settings page: general, dock, desktop-icons, app-grid, top-bar, "
"windows or clipboard"
msgstr ""
"Atvērt iestatījumu lapu: general, dock, desktop-icons, app-grid, top-bar, "
"windows vai clipboard"

#: src/deskence/application.py:97
msgid "PAGE"
msgstr "LAPA"

